---
const items = [
  {
    title: 'Standards other teams build on',
    body: 'Proposed a Radix + Tailwind design system with accessibility built into the components. All new UI at TRM is built on it.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Contracts across team boundaries',
    body: 'Generated OpenAPI types in a pre-commit hook and CI, so a breaking backend change fails in the backend PR instead of in production.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Guardrails that scale review',
    body: 'Typed translation keys and CI checks that catch missing translations before merge, with agent rules so AI-written PRs follow the same process.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Tooling for an AI-native team',
    body: 'Split a 3,000-line agent instruction file into scoped skills, built a parallel git-worktree skill, and wrote agents the team used daily.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Prototype before building',
    body: 'Built working prototypes with AI agents and tested them with internal investigators before committing to a design, then proposed one assistant instead of two.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Confidence at speed',
    body: 'Pushed for regression coverage as AI-assisted PR volume grew, and led a 20+ PR performance push in small, reviewable, revertable steps.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section wrap" id="leverage" aria-labelledby="leverage-title">
  <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="leverage-title">How I make a team faster</h2>
    <p>The work that doesn’t show up in a screenshot: systems that make everyone else’s PRs safer.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="leverage">
    {items.map((item, index) => (
      <li class="card" data-reveal>
        <span class="leverage__n mono">0{index + 1}</span>
        <h3>{item.title}</h3>
        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .leverage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .leverage li {
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .leverage__n {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .leverage h3 {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .leverage p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
